#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0143 expect=skipped domain=ADSL
#note "The name test makes this SUBJECT LEVEL ANALYSIS DATASET before the PARAMCD column can suggest BDS. Firing data, but the rule's Data_Structures Include is [BASIC DATA STRUCTURE, MEDICAL DEVICE BASIC DATA STRUCTURE] -> out of scope, not executed. Also pins the name-test precedence: without it a PARAMCD column would have detected BDS."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADSL
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | gluc
